{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-ladder-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-semantic-told-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T04:56:16.210Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"ae4d33c6690bade593e79f05963f6c873356e085e1e2d9ef2464ddf170869af6","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","text":"I set up the brief, but it won't post until the Hermes gateway is started. I've replied to Ruth in #strategic-random's thread.\n\n- **Schedule:** a daily job named \"Strategic pod brief\" runs at 07:45 Chicago time, which is 12:45 UTC while Chicago is on CDT. The scheduler runs in UTC, so the time shifts to 13:45 UTC when DST ends on 1 November. It will then need updating to `45 13 * * *`.\n- **Start date:** the scheduler has no start-date option, so the job runs daily from when it is enabled, not specifically from tomorrow.\n- **Scope:** the brief posts to #strategic-random, reads the three channels, and leaves out finance figures and documents and anything from DMs. It does not use search.\n\nJob ID is 927706be8240."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000128"}}
